  "content": "<h1>Capital，現在已自動化！</h1>\n<p><em><strong>由Untitled Modding Cooperation帶來</strong></em></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcreate-trading-floor%252fguide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/cakeGit/Create-Trading-Floor/blob/1.20.1/shelf/tradingfloor_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage banner\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7DvmP0f2wXE&ab_channel=SomeGuyCalledCak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">看看實際運作！</a></h2>\n<p>簡單來說，<strong>新增了交易倉庫方塊</strong>，可以在Create模組中用來在白天自動與村民進行交易。該方塊具備完整的功能，支援護目鏡、顯示連結、輸送帶、滑槽和過濾器</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4635c03eeffbe7da1c221f98494c34db2a3039e6.png\" alt=\"Villagers trading using the depot\"></p>",
